<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's African Petroleum profit dips.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's African Petroleum profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for African Petroleum to end-June 1996.</p>
<p>			    (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,600  vs  1,800</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   690  vs    920</p>
<p> Taxation		     217  vs    344</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    473  vs    585</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
